rise a whole  new way to think about business and a  whole new way to think about capitalism  to just reiterate the three primary  purposes the conscious business or  conscious capitalism the enterprise has  a deeper purpose that includes but goes  beyond maximizing profits and  shareholder value the enterprise has  managed optimized value on behalf of all  the stakeholders and servant leadership  to the enterprise into its stakeholders  is the purpose and function of the  leadership of the enterprise thanks very  much
 

